_shots/
screenshots/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
# …but the real site assets are committed: the share card is what
# WhatsApp and X fetch, so it must be in the repo and deployed.
!assets/og-card.png
!assets/favicon.svg

# ── Local server / environment noise ────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Keep the deploy workflow (it lives in a dot-folder) ─────────
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/*.yml

# ── Temporary research dumps (raw page saves used to verify) ────
/tmp-dumps/
*.raw.html
*.orig
*.bak
*.backup.*

# ── Local tool state (agent memory, sessions, caches) ───────────
.workbuddy-ai/
